{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52354","headline":"诗（幷序） 一一五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一一五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慧心（一作「眼」）近空心，非关（一作「开」）髑髅孔。\n对面说不识，饶你母姓董。\n（见张锡厚《王梵志诗校辑》卷六，出敦煌本《历代法宝记》）（按：《历代法宝记》谓无住禅师引王梵志此诗，《全唐诗续补遗》误收入无住名下，今移正。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}